repository-code: https://github.com/isundahl/LLM_Plugin
url: https://github.com/isundahl/LLM_Plugin
abstract: >-
  A Win64 Unreal Engine runtime plug-in for private offline NPC dialogue with
  local GGUF inference, speech recognition and synthesis, multi-character
  sessions, memory, relationship context, routing, and constrained tool calls.
keywords:
  - Unreal Engine
  - local LLM
  - llama.cpp
  - NPC dialogue
  - speech recognition
  - text to speech
  - generative AI
